        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sam Wood, Robert Taylor, John Hodiak, Arlene Dahl, Luke Short\n- Works: Ambush (1950 film), \"Ambush\" (serial story)\n- Organizations: Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer, The Saturday Evening Post\n- Topics: Western films, film adaptation\n\nFacts:\n- \"Ambush\" was a serial story by Luke Short published in The Saturday Evening Post from December 25, 1948 to February 12, 1949.\n- Ambush is a 1950 Western film directed by Sam Wood and starring Robert Taylor, John Hodiak, and Arlene Dahl.\n- The plot of Ambush is based on Luke Short's serial story \"Ambush.\"\n- Arlene Carol Dahl was born on August 11, 1925.\n- Arlene Dahl is an American actress and a former Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer contract star.\n- Arlene Dahl achieved notability during the 1950s.",
